 * Original procedural Canvas 2D artwork. No dependencies or external assets.
 * One scene, 25 seconds, seamless deterministic loop, responsive 16:9.
 * Interface: draw(ctx, timeInSeconds, width, height).
 * Recommended video export: 3840 x 2160, 60 fps, 100,000,000 bit/s.
